-- INTERFACE ---------------- errors/missing_impl_7.march

String does not implement Num (only Int and Float do). [missing_impl]
`+` needs it here.

4 |     List.fold_left([1, 2], "", fn (acc, x) -> acc + x)
                                                  ^^^^^^^

    March joins strings with `++`, not `+`. To put a number in a string, convert it first: `"total: " ++ int_to_string(n)`.


